Sun Nov 15 14:15:00 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- BuildRequires: name the module upstream actually calls. meson.build:122
  asks for dependency('libei-1.0', version: '>=1.3') (tests/ is built by
  default: option('tests', value: true)), while the spec declared
  pkgconfig(libeis-1.0) -- the EIS server module, never referenced in the
  tree. Both .pc files ship in libei-devel, which is why it still built,
  but the declaration is now the one the code requires.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
